cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the paper given under
  preferred-citation.
type: software
title: "ucci: reference implementation of UCCI (Calibrated Uncertainty for Cost-Optimal LLM Cascade Routing)"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of UCCI, a calibration-first router for two-model
  LLM cascades. It maps the small model's token-margin uncertainty to a
  per-query error probability by isotonic regression and escalates to the
  large model when that probability exceeds the threshold selected by
  constrained cost minimization on validation data. The package provides the
  core method (numpy only), serving adapters for OpenAI-compatible APIs, vLLM,
  Hugging Face transformers and llama.cpp, the paper's baselines and
  evaluation protocol, a command line tool, a Rust crate with bit-identical
  results on shared golden vectors, and a public replication on CoNLL-2003.
authors:
